    description: "Concept audit 2026-10-21/22 (pinned dev e9215548f6; write-up ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/concept-audit-vocabulary-since-0923_10222026.md). Adjacent findings. ContentRule.ecosystem (discovery.py:911-925, 'display label') holds ~45 values mixing package managers, build tools, detection mechanisms ('self-ignored output', 'cache directory (CACHEDIR.TAG)') and 'git submodule'; it is re-emitted as 'tool' for generated output (discovery.py:1861, supply_chain.py:1538) and branched on at discovery.py:1831; ADR-0041 section 3 owns 'ecosystem' for stdlib/third_party. Recommended: rename the field to tool. channel_kind (axis_meta_keys.py:564-566) declares example 'message_queue' while producers emit 'queue'; Phoenix Channels (WebSocket transport) carry 'ipc' (linkers/phoenix_ipc.py:357). KEEP with trigger: generic Edge.meta keys call_type / method (axis_meta_keys.py:1482-1487, 1590-1594) -- re-audit on their first reader."  # 8850
